    "summary": [
      "Retained the 0.4.0 compatible CRT idempotent splitting, 1000-adic completion and unique infinite positional expansion",
      "Added the two-channel arithmetic of radix 1000=2^3*5^3, including unit criteria, residue geometry and carry laws under explicit assumptions",
      "Added the ten-layer K3-M finite-profile morphology, with open questions and finite-catalogue limitations retained",
      "Added explicit ordered expression and directed block composition semantics, separate from integer addition",
      "Added typed applied mathematical models and traceability for DAK, Reaper, Pytyliki, OPlague and VentuSample without claiming source-project implementation",
      "Added a unified applied-mathematical atlas coordinating the five domain chapters, K3 encoding boundaries, cross-project contracts and open proof obligations.",
      "Added typed applied mathematical models and traceability for DAK, Reaper and VentuSample without claiming source-project implementation",
      "Added K3-NT, a documentation-only research model of invariant-violation load, weakly connected defect clusters, directed dependency propagation and twenty threshold-based metaphorical levels; empirical calibration remains open.",
      "Added a typed interdisciplinary dynamic and information synthesis shared by K3 and CV-1",
      "Formalized global graph-flow balance and monotonicity of quadratic graph-diffusion energy under explicit assumptions",
      "Added phase sampling, memory provenance, oscillator, execution-state, nonlocal-transition, rate-distortion and cross-layer research models without changing K3 base semantics"
    ]
  },
